{"ticker":"LIN","updated":"2026-10-30T22:56:47Z","profile":{"longName":"Linde plc","shortName":"Linde plc","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"United Kingdom","website":"https://www.linde.com","fullTimeEmployees":65177,"marketCap":236079235072,"trailingPE":33.198193,"forwardPE":26.322172,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.514687,"pegRatio":1.96,"targetMeanPrice":545.55554,"targetHighPrice":591.0,"targetLowPrice":400.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.092,"earningsGrowth":-0.105,"grossMargins":0.47864,"operatingMargins":0.23384,"profitMargins":0.19336,"totalRevenue":36238000128,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":548.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":387.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.27},"summary":"Linde plc operates as an industrial gas company worldwide. The company offers atmospheric gases, including oxygen, nitrogen, argon, and rare gases; and process gases, such as hydrogen, helium, carbon dioxide, carbon monoxide, electronic gases, specialty gases, and acetylene. It also engages in the design and construction of turnkey process plants for third-party customers, as well as for its gas businesses, including air separation, hydrogen, synthesis, olefin, and natural gas plants. The company serves the healthcare, chemicals and energy, manufacturing, metals and mining, food and beverage, and electronics industries. It operates in the United States, Brazil, Mexico, Canada, Germany, the United Kingdom, Eastern Europe, China, Australia, South Korea, and India. Linde plc was founded in 1879 and is based in Woking, the United Kingdom.","summary_zh":"林德公司是一家全球工業氣體公司。公司提供大氣氣體，包括氧氣、氮氣、氬氣和稀有氣體；以及製程氣體，例如氫氣、氦氣、二氧化碳、一氧化碳、電子氣體、特殊氣體和乙炔。它也為第三方客戶及其天然氣業務設計和建造交鑰匙加工廠，包括空氣分離、氫氣、合成、烯烴和天然氣工廠。該公司服務於醫療保健、化學品和能源、製造、金屬和採礦、食品和飲料以及電子行業。該公司在美國、巴西、墨西哥、加拿大、德國、英國、東歐、中國、澳洲、韓國和印度開展業務。林德公司成立於 1879 年，總部位於英國沃金。","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"特種化學品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":477.17,"h":477.17,"l"