eric gases (oxygen, nitrogen, argon, and rare gases) and process gases (hydrogen, helium, carbon dioxide, carbon monoxide, electronic gases, specialty gases, and acetylene). The company also designs and builds equipment that produces industrial gases and offers customers a wide range of gas production and processing services such as olefin plants, natural gas plants, air separation plants, hydrogen and synthesis gas plants, and other types of plants.","zh":null},{"en":"Linde serves a diverse group of industries including healthcare, chemicals and energy, manufacturing, metals and mining, food and beverage, and electronics.","zh":null},{"en":"Linde's sales were $33,986 million, $33,005 million, and $32,854 million for 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively. Refer to Item 7, Management's Discussion and Analysis, for a discussion of consolidated sales and Note 18 to the consolidated financial statements for additional information related to Linde's reportable segments.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":15208000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":8549000000,"zh":"EMEA"},{"name":"APAC","val":6661000000,"zh":"APAC"},{"name":"Engineering","val":2250000000,"zh":"Engineering"}],"total":33986000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":12182000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other International","val":11259000000,"zh":"Other International"},{"name":"CN","val":2600000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"DE","val":2432000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"GB","val":1510000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"MX","val":1391000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"BR","val":1325000000,"zh":"BR"},{"name":"AU","val":1287000000,"zh":"AU"}],"total":33986000000}},"peers":["APD","SPGI","ECL","SHW","ROP"]}}